<title>UK: SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST ROUND, SECOND LEG COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST ROUND, SECOND LEG COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of UEFA Cup first round, second leg matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>In Kerkrade: </p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade (Netherlands) 2 Schalke (Germany) 2 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Roda - Edwin Vurens (25th minute), Gerald Sibon (74th)</p>
<p>Schalke - David Wagner (15th), Marc Wilmots (72nd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 14,000</p>
<p>Schalke won 5-2 on aggregate</p>
