<p>National Bucharest (Romania) 2 Chornomorets Odessa (Ukraine) 0  (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Danut Moisescu (48th), Radu Niculescu (57th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
<p>National won 2-0 on aggregate.</p>
